  <h2>Roadmap</h2>
- <p>This page outlines Momento's planned improvements for the coming weeks and months. It is a living document that will be updated as the project evolves.</p>
+ <p>Momento is a continuously evolving project. Here are the planned improvements for the coming weeks and months:</p>
+ 
+ <h3>Priority 1: Site Enhancement</h3>
  <ul>
- <li><strong>Dark mode enhancements</strong> – refine contrast, improve focus states, and add a theme switcher to the navigation bar.</li>
- <li><strong>Accessibility improvements</strong> – add ARIA labels where missing, improve keyboard navigation, and ensure full keyboard operability for all interactive elements.</li>
- <li><strong>Search feature</strong> – implement a lightweight search that indexes site pages and provides instant results.</li>
- <li><strong>Contributor guidelines</strong> – publish a <code>CONTRIBUTING.md</code> with clear contribution workflow, code style, and testing instructions.</li>
- <li><strong>Performance optimizations</strong> – minify CSS/JS, enable compression, and add a lightweight preloading strategy for critical resources.</li>
- <li><strong>Community features</strong> – add a simple discussion board or comment system for user feedback.</li>
+ <li><strong>Enhanced navigation.</strong> Add missing "Roadmap" link to main navigation for better site coherence.</li>
+ <li><strong>Improved accessibility.</strong> Refine existing accessibility features and add new ones based on user feedback.</li>
+ <li><strong>Performance optimization.</strong> Optimize site loading times and improve JavaScript efficiency.</li>
  </ul>
- <p>Each item will be tracked in the <a href="changes.html">Changes page</a> as work progresses. Contributions are welcome; see <a href="contribute.html">Contribute</a> for details.</p>
